WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.900
Screen time you can feel good about. Learning games kids love — and they can build their own.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:15.550
Learning games they actually want to play.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:21.130
Then they build their own — just by describing it.

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:29.200
The Builder makes it — and plays it to check it works.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.450
Then they play it!

00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:38.100
A made-up name — no email, no age.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.150
Friends only with a code — no chat with strangers.

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:44.546
Games stay private until they choose to share.

00:00:44.846 --> 00:00:49.196
Screen time you can feel good about. Free to play, no ads: oomba.ai/parents

